### W10. Emergency / casualty [NEW]

**Trigger:** patient arrives in critical condition.
**Steps:** NUR (or any clinical staff) registers as "Unknown" or with minimum data → triage colour assigned → DOC treats immediately → orders raised with status "emergency" (payment gate bypassed) → stabilised: continue to OPD, admission, referral or discharge → REC later completes the full record; if unknown, merge to real record (ADM) → CSH raises the bill after treatment; unpaid emergency bills go to the credit or waiver process.
**Rules:** never block life-saving treatment for payment; every bypass is flagged and listed in the daily exception report; unknown records are marked until resolved.
**Audit events:** `emergency.register`, `payment.gate.bypass`, `patient.merge`.

